WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.047 --> 00:00:08.024
"I don't understand," Roxy said.

2
00:00:08.025 --> 00:00:11.871
"I see a city, but nobody's here!"

3
00:00:11.872 --> 00:00:15.835
"Confused, you," Bippo said.

4
00:00:15.836 --> 00:00:24.104
Cozlin sighed. "There's a reason why the Hulzarians are experts in portal technology.

5
00:00:24.105 --> 00:00:26.653
They're afraid of everyone!

6
00:00:26.654 --> 00:00:31.021
They use their portals to escape whenever they're scared.

7
00:00:31.022 --> 00:00:34.678
They probably saw us coming."

8
00:00:34.679 --> 00:00:41.271
Voop! A portal opened, and an alien peeked out, looking nervous.

9
00:00:41.272 --> 00:00:46.612
"That's a Hulzarian," Cozlin said. She ran toward the portal.

10
00:00:46.613 --> 00:00:50.414
"Hey!" The portal swirled shut.

11
00:00:50.415 --> 00:00:54.297
Another portal opened. Voop!

12
00:00:54.298 --> 00:00:59.938
"Who are you?" a Hulzarian asked. "What do you want?"

13
00:00:59.939 --> 00:01:05.148
"Don't close that portal!" Cozlin shouted as she and Roxy ran toward it.

14
00:01:05.149 --> 00:01:08.769
The Hulzarian held up a device. Voop!

15
00:01:08.770 --> 00:01:15.445
A new portal opened. Roxy and Cozlin tumbled through.

16
00:01:15.446 --> 00:01:18.703
"Huh?" Roxy scratched her head.

17
00:01:18.704 --> 00:01:21.897
She and Cozlin were now facing a metal wall.

18
00:01:21.898 --> 00:01:24.262
She turned and gasped.

19
00:01:24.263 --> 00:01:27.428
They were in a room with one of Meltron's robots!

20
00:01:27.429 --> 00:01:29.776
They got ready to fight.

21
00:01:29.777 --> 00:01:35.263
"Wait, you." Bippo hopped onto the robot.

22
00:01:35.264 --> 00:01:41.371
He tapped its head, which made an empty clinking sound. "Disabled, him."

23
00:01:41.372 --> 00:01:46.282
Roxy took a closer look at the robot. "You're right, Bippo."

24
00:01:46.283 --> 00:01:55.901
Cozlin noticed thick metal bars on one end of the room. "We're in a prison cell."

25
00:01:55.902 --> 00:01:59.361
"Criminals, us," Bippo said.

26
00:01:59.362 --> 00:02:05.042
"We're not criminals," Roxy said. "This is a misunderstanding."

27
00:02:05.043 --> 00:02:08.484
A Hulzarian approached their cell.

28
00:02:08.485 --> 00:02:15.058
"Not criminals, huh? Then why did your robot attack us?"

29
00:02:15.059 --> 00:02:18.188
Cozlin looked at the broken robot.

30
00:02:18.189 --> 00:02:25.110
"That's not our robot," she said. "We're trying to fight those robots."

31
00:02:25.111 --> 00:02:31.869
The Hulzarian raised her eyebrow. "How do I know you're telling the truth?"

32
00:02:31.870 --> 00:02:40.649
"Easy," Cozlin said. Shloomp! She stepped through the bars.

33
00:02:40.650 --> 00:02:46.986
"We have super powers! If we wanted to attack, we wouldn't need that robot."

34
00:02:46.987 --> 00:02:50.113
The Hulzarian took a step back.

35
00:02:50.114 --> 00:02:55.796
Roxy sighed. "There are a lot more of those robots.

36
00:02:55.797 --> 00:02:58.703
And they've been taking over planets.

37
00:02:58.704 --> 00:03:00.965
We know how to stop them.

38
00:03:00.966 --> 00:03:05.698
But we need a portal to find someone to help us."

39
00:03:05.699 --> 00:03:09.192
"So it's true," the Hulzarian said.

40
00:03:09.193 --> 00:03:14.667
"We received reports of robots attacking other planets."

41
00:03:14.668 --> 00:03:20.018
She released Roxy from the cell.

42
00:03:20.019 --> 00:03:28.947
Then she held up a device. "I'm sending you to our portal makers."

43
00:03:28.948 --> 00:03:32.997
Voop! Suddenly Roxy and Cozlin were in a different room.

44
00:03:32.998 --> 00:03:40.248
A Hulzarian sat behind a desk. "Please describe the world you need to visit."

45
00:03:40.249 --> 00:03:42.738
Roxy quickly described the world.

46
00:03:42.739 --> 00:03:46.156
The Hulzarian nodded as he typed on a computer.

47
00:03:46.157 --> 00:03:50.849
Then he held up a device. Voop!

48
00:03:50.850 --> 00:03:56.111
Now Roxy and Cozlin were in a room filled with machines and other strange equipment.

49
00:03:56.112 --> 00:03:59.975
Several Hulzarians were busy working.

50
00:03:59.976 --> 00:04:03.794
"These portals are making me dizzy," Roxy said.

51
00:04:03.795 --> 00:04:06.548
"Couldn't we have just walked here?"

52
00:04:06.549 --> 00:04:13.225
A Hulzarian chuckled. "I'm Flix, and no. You were just on our moon.

53
00:04:13.226 --> 00:04:19.527
Now you're deep under the surface of Hulzar."

54
00:04:19.528 --> 00:04:21.836
He handed them a device.

55
00:04:21.837 --> 00:04:27.929
"This is your portal projector. Strap it to your wrist."

56
00:04:27.930 --> 00:04:30.999
Cozlin nodded and put it on.

57
00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:35.483
"Just press the button to activate the portal," Flix said.

58
00:04:35.484 --> 00:04:41.668
"It will act as a doorway between the world you're going to and this laboratory. Good luck."

59
00:04:41.669 --> 00:04:45.300
"Thanks!" Cozlin pressed the button.

60
00:04:45.301 --> 00:04:54.307
Voop! A portal opened. Roxy and Cozlin jumped in.

